  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00259",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "那一晚，我整整一夜沒有閤眼，一直在埋頭閱讀這三篇手記。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That night, I did not close my eyes once, but spent the whole night absorbed in reading these three notebooks.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00259",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "手記裡寫的都是以往的故事，但現代人看了肯定也會很感興趣。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The notebooks were all about things from the past, but modern readers would surely find them very interesting.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00259",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我想，與其拙劣地去添筆潤色修改，不如原封不動寄到雜誌社發表更具有意義。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I thought it would be more meaningful to send them unchanged to a magazine for publication than to clumsily add to them, polish them, or revise them myself.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00259",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "給孩子們買的海產品盡是乾貨。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The seafood I had bought for the children was all dried goods.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00259",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "我揹著揹包，告別朋友，又來到了這家咖啡館。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "With my backpack on my back, I said goodbye to my friend and came once again to this cafe.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00259",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "「昨天謝謝你了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Thank you for yesterday.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00259",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "不過……」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But, well...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00259",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "我馬上直奔主題，說道，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I immediately got to the point and said,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00259",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "「這些筆記本，能借我一段時間嗎？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Could you lend me these notebooks for a while?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00259",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "「可以啊，請。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yes, of course. Go ahead.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00259",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "「這個人還健在嗎？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Is this person still alive?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00259",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "「啊，這我可就不知道了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Well, that I really do not know.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
